1
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:09,267
Every change on this board is a journey.

2
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:18,600
Each letter sits on a wheel of forty flaps. It turns one way only.

3
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:24,400
From B back to A is one step. Here, it is thirty-nine.

4
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:32,800
So when a train is late, the board writes the whole line again.

5
00:00:37,200 --> 00:00:41,267
The last train leaves in ten seconds.

6
00:00:51,600 --> 00:00:56,867
Even going back means going forward, all the way round.
